### Stack Components Breakdown

| Layer | Selected Technologies | Rationale / Key Design Decisions |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Kiosk Shell** | Electron + Next.js (React / TS) + Zustand | Locked-down Electron container with `contextIsolation: true`, `nodeIntegration: false`, strict CSP, and native watchdog auto-restart. |
| **Edge Vision** | MediaPipe Tasks Vision (`@mediapipe/tasks-vision`) | Runs in Web Worker via GPU delegate. Pose Landmarker (Full/Heavy) + Face Landmarker. Replaces legacy TF.js to eliminate redundant runtime overhead. |
| **API Gateway** | FastAPI (Python) | High-performance async gateway, Pydantic v2 schemas, OpenAPI specification, mTLS kiosk authentication. Replaces NestJS. |
| **Queueing** | Redis + Celery | Priority queues (`tryon.interactive`, `tryon.batch`, `ingest.garments`), late acknowledgments (`acks_late=True`), hard 30s queue TTL timeout. |
| **AI Inference Engine**| PyTorch + Hugging Face Diffusers | Model-adapter pattern (`TryOnModel` interface) supporting CatVTON, IDM-VTON, or custom/commercial models. FP16 baseline. |
| **Storage Layer** | PostgreSQL + Redis + MinIO/NVMe | PostgreSQL for relational metadata (catalog, kiosks, audit logs). Redis for session state. MinIO/NVMe for encrypted ephemeral image storage (15-min TTL). |

