## Risk Matrix & Mitigation Strategies

| Risk Factor | Likelihood | Impact | Proposed Mitigation Strategy |
| :--- | :---: | :---: | :--- |
| **VTON Model Licensing** | High | Critical | Phase 0 legal gate; decoupled `TryOnModel` adapter interface; commercial model API fallback. |
| **Textured/Sheer Fabric Failures**| High | High | Automated suitability score in ingestion pipeline; hard fabric regression test suite (stripes, lace, knits). |
| **Sizing Inaccuracy** | Medium | High | Tape-measurement ground truth validation on 100+ volunteers; confidence rating display; optional depth camera upgrade. |
| **GPU Infrastructure Costs** | Medium | High | Capacity planning model; Redis result caching within sessions; catalog prewarming; start with cloud GPUs (RunPod/Modal/L4) before on-prem. |
| **Biometric Legal Liability** | Medium | Critical | Explicit on-screen consent flow, zero persistent image storage, strict 15-min TTL purge, regional legal audit. |

