## Key Open Decisions & Recommendations for Engineering

1. **VTON Model Selection & Commercial Rights:** Prioritize Phase 0 legal audit of weights and dataset licenses (VITON-HD vs commercial proprietary alternatives).
2. **Depth vs RGB Sizing:** Validate RGB-only shape regression accuracy on 100 volunteers first; keep hardware design modular to support optional USB Depth cameras (RealSense).
3. **GPU Deployment Strategy:** Launch Phase 1-2 on elastic cloud GPUs (L4 / L40S) to avoid initial capital expenditure, transitioning to dedicated datacenter nodes once kiosk utilization stabilizes.
4. **Take-Home Result Options:** If QR code or Email sharing is desired by brands, implement a separate explicit opt-in privacy agreement detached from the default ephemeral kiosk session.
